  (text "Notes\nU11: SET2..0 = 010: 30 ms startup delay and timeout (minimum), so outputs drop within 50 ms. WDO pulses; U13 latches it\nR102: gate shut while the MCU is in reset\nU13: D flip-flop: rising GATE_EN sets GATE_ARM, a watchdog trip clears it until the next rising edge\nU12: GATE = GATE_EN and armed (no watchdog trip since)\nR103: firmware reads the gate back (PD8)\nU14: pinout checked against datasheet Rev 2.1 (31 Oct). Serial mode 3: SEL high, MS0/MS1 high, ALE/RST low; ODIS active low from GATE. No LED matrix: X pins tied, Y pins tied. The package has two exposed\n    pads (GND and GNDBB): footprint is a placeholder to redraw from the package drawing\nR104: CLKADJ, high-precision 10k (datasheet)\nR105: IADJ, 6.81k only (datasheet)\nR106: open-load threshold, about 1 mA (2.3k-25k allowed: 5-0.5 mA)\nC110: per output, datasheet application circuit"
    (at 15.24 347.98 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left top))
    (uuid 5af6eb8a-59df-566b-8360-e369e3e9fe1c)
  )
  (text "\nJ10: same pinout as the breakout J1, straight-through ribbon\nF10: ribbon +24 V (breakout LEDs)\nU15: pinout checked against DS14170 (31 Oct). Tab = VCC (+24V_FB): copper pour on the field side only\nC200: bank B bulk\nJ11: 8 A return over 2 contacts: CHECK the plug rating (8 A per contact)\nD31: flyback at the terminal, as on the breakout\nD41: NOT FITTED. fast-release option (remove the 0R)\nD42: NOT FITTED.\nD43: NOT FITTED.\nD44: NOT FITTED.\nD45: NOT FITTED."
    (at 203.2 347.98 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left top))
    (uuid 2b3915d0-cb3f-5057-9dec-6bb2538f24dc)
  )
  (text "\nD46: NOT FITTED.\nD47: NOT FITTED.\nD48: NOT FITTED.\nU16: serial mode; internal DC/DC off (DC_ENA low), field side from VBB. Values from Infineon's ISO1I813T evaluation board. Pinout checked against the datasheet (31 Oct): serial mode 3 (24-bit, CRC)\nR118: 22.1k: about 500 kHz scan (datasheet typical)\nR119: type 1 (eval board RTS = 33 ohm; datasheet: type 2 = 33k, type 3 = 330k). CHECK type 1 value\nR120: wire-break current, 25-55k range (datasheet curves)\nR122: RIN, eval board\nR123: RLED (no LED here; the breakout has them)\nJ12: same pinout as the breakout J1\nF11: sensor supply down the input ribbon"
    (at 391.16 347.98 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left top))
    (uuid bed28f4e-b463-539d-95f0-9889a2f9b3c4)
  )

